# 《The Inn》简体中文翻译 · special_screens/tutorials

translate simplified_chinese strings:

    old "WELCOME TO THE PHONE MAIN SCREEN!"
    new "欢迎来到手机主界面！"

    old "So, here we are, this is your phone main screen. This will serve mostly as a hub for all the game mechanics and other features."
    new "好了，我们到了——这就是你的手机主界面。它主要会作为所有游戏机制和其他功能的总枢纽。"

    old "Right now you have some pretty neat features unlocked already, with even more to come later on! So, let's get this show on the road."
    new "你现在已经解锁了不少相当好用的功能，后面还会有更多！那我们就开始吧。"

    old "Each icon on this screen grants access to a different feature on the phone system, those features are:"
    new "这个界面上的每个图标都对应手机系统中的一项功能，分别是："

    old "Profile: This gives you access to the Profile Page of the phone, in there you will be able to see relevant information about the protagonist and the girls."
    new "档案：进入手机的档案页，在那里可以查看主角和各位姑娘的相关信息。"

    old "Gallery: This takes you to the Gallery Page of the phone. In there you'll find all kinds of pictures you either receive from the girls through SMS, unlock through story events or find around the world."
    new "图库：进入手机的图库页，在那里能看到各种图片——姑娘们通过短信发给你的、剧情事件解锁的，或你在世界各地捡到的。"

    old "Special Episodes: This will take you to the Special Episodes Page of the phone. From there you'll be able to play all the special episodes released for the game."
    new "特别章节：进入手机的特别章节页，从那里可以游玩本游戏已发布的全部特别章节。"

    old "Wallpapers: This will take you to the Wallpapers Page of the Phone. In there you will be able to change the wallpaper used on the phone and even customize it to one of your liking!"
    new "壁纸：进入手机的壁纸页，在那里可以更换手机壁纸，还能按自己的喜好裁剪！"

    old "Wardrobe: This will take you to the Wardrobe Page of the Phone. In there you will be able to change the protagonist's and the girls' clothing items. It's basically a dress-up customization game."
    new "衣柜：进入手机的衣柜页，在那里可以更换主角和各位姑娘的服装。说白了就是个换装游戏。"

    old "Settings: This will take you to the Settings Page of the Phone. You'll find plenty of options related to the phone in there."
    new "设置：进入手机的设置页，里面有大量与手机有关的选项。"

    old "Navigation Buttons: At the bottom left corner of the phone screen you will notice a couple of special buttons, they are:"
    new "导航按钮：手机界面左下角有几个特殊按钮，分别是："

    old "{color=#ff0000}Close{/color}: This button will automatically close the Phone Screen, exiting all submenus you're in, taking you back to the Navigation Screen."
    new "{color=#ff0000}关闭{/color}：这个按钮会直接关掉手机界面，退出你当前所在的任何子菜单，回到导航界面。"

    old "{color=#00ff00}Return{/color}: When you're on a submenu or page, this button will appear besides the Close Button, clicking it will take take you back to the previous screen you were in (usually the Main Screen or the Character Selection Screen)."
    new "{color=#00ff00}返回{/color}：当你在某个子菜单或页面时，这个按钮会出现在「关闭」旁边，点它就会回到上一个界面（通常是主界面或角色选择界面）。"

    old "This is pretty much the basic for this section of the phone. You're now free to explore all the other sub-menus!"
    new "手机这部分的基础内容就是这些。现在你可以随意探索其他所有子菜单了！"

    old "WELCOME TO THE NAVIGATION SYSTEM!"
    new "欢迎来到导航系统！"

    old "This tutorial will explain how the navigation system works on this game, so buckle up, that's gonna be a wild ride!"
    new "本教程将讲解本游戏的导航系统运作方式，系好安全带，这会是一段疯狂的旅程！"

    old "Out of the bat, the general navigation is pretty simple. At the bottom left corner you'll see a row of round icons, each one representing a room on your current location, to navigate through the rooms you just need to click on the icon and let the magic happen."
    new "总的来说，导航本身相当简单。左下角有一排圆形图标，每个代表你当前地点的一个房间；想在房间之间切换，只需点一下图标，魔法就会发生。"

    old "There are, tough, some special elements on this system that may require your attention, here's a brief explanation of what they are are and what they do:"
    new "不过，这套系统里也有一些需要你留意的特殊元素，下面简单说明它们是什么、有什么用："

    old "At the top part of the screen you'll see 3 elements, they are the following:"
    new "屏幕顶部有 3 个元素，分别是："

    old "Top Left Corner: This is the day, hour and day of the week display. It'll show, well... Take a wild guess..."
    new "左上角：显示日期、时间和星期。至于显示什么嘛……你就猜猜看吧……"

    old "Top Center: This is the date display. It shows the current in-game date."
    new "顶部中央：日期显示，标示游戏内的当前日期。"

    old "Top Right Corner: This is the location display. It shows what location and room you're currently in."
    new "右上角：位置显示，告诉你当前所在的地点和房间。"

    old "When there are events active for either characters or locations, a visual cue will be displayed at the navigation icons:"
    new "当角色或地点有正在进行的事件时，导航图标上会显示相应的提示："

    old "When a STAR is shown on the room icon, it means there's a {u}Location Event{/u} active for that room. {u}Location Events{/u} will start as soon as you enter the room."
    new "房间图标上出现星星，表示该房间有进行中的{u}地点事件{/u}。{u}地点事件{/u}会在你进入房间后立即开始。"

    old "When the WARDROBE icon appears inside the STAR, it means the {u}Location Event{/u} active for that room is compatible with the Phone's Wardrobe feature. The clothes you set for the characters there will be the ones they'll be wearing during the event."
    new "星星里如果出现了衣柜图标，说明该房间进行中的{u}地点事件{/u}与手机的衣柜功能兼容。你在那里为角色设置的服装，就是事件中她们会穿的服装。"

    old "When a STAR is shown on a character's bobblehead, it means there's a {u}Character Event{/u} active for that character. To start a {u}Character Event{/u}, you need to be in the same room as the character and click on that character."
    new "角色小立绘上出现星星，表示该角色有进行中的{u}角色事件{/u}。要开启{u}角色事件{/u}，你需要和该角色处在同一个房间，然后点击她。"

    old "Sometimes a location will have both a Character Event and a Location Event active at the same time. Location Events take precedence over Character Events, that means they'll be triggered before."
    new "有时一个地点会同时有角色事件和地点事件在进行。地点事件的优先级高于角色事件，也就是说它们会先被触发。"

    old "Last but not least, at the left side of the screen you have the Event Log icon. It will give you access to the Event Log screen. The Event Log screen contains detailed information about either active or finished events you encountered during gameplay."
    new "最后但同样重要的是，界面左侧还有事件记录图标，点它可以进入事件记录界面。那里记录着你在游戏过程中遇到的、正在进行或已完成的事件的详细信息。"

    old "And that's the gist of it, have fun playing!"
    new "大致就是这样，祝你玩得开心！"

    old "WHAT'S THIS THING SHAKING???"
    new "这什么东西在抖啊？？？"

    old "Oh hey, look! You just reached that part on the game where the phone is unlocked!"
    new "哦对了，你刚玩到手机解锁的部分！"

    old "However, because I'm a stupid fucking dev and can't code for shit, it currently has an SMS event going on for it..."
    new "不过，因为作者我是个蠢得要命的混账，代码写得一塌糊涂，所以这会儿导航上正挂着一个短信事件……"

    old "So, let's take a quick look at it first and then we can proceed to YET {u}another{/u} tutorial explaining how the phone works."
    new "那么先带你看一眼，之后我们再进入关于手机的{u}另{/u}一份教程。"

    old "At the left side of the screen you may have noticed a new icon popped up with a red dot. This is the Phone Button, the red dot on it indicates that you just received an SMS message from someone and the number inside it shows how many unread SMS messages you have."
    new "界面左侧，你可能已经注意到冒出一个带红点的新图标。这就是手机按钮；上面的红点表示你刚收到某人的短信，里面的数字表示你有几条未读短信。"

    old "To see what those messages are you just need to click on the shaking icon (it's pretty annoying, I know), and you'll be taken directly to the SMS screen."
    new "想看那些短信说了什么，点一下那个抖个不停的图标就行（我知道，是挺烦人的），你会直接进入短信界面。"

    old "Go ahead, close this window and click on the shaking button!"
    new "去吧，关掉这个窗口，然后点那个抖动的按钮！"

    old "ALRIGHT, THAT TAKES CARE OF THAT!"
    new "好，这个问题解决了！"

    old "Now that you have read all the SMS messages we can move on to the Phone Tutorial!"
    new "既然你已经读完所有短信，我们就进入手机教程吧！"

    old "Have you noticed that the Phone Button stopped shaking and the red dot is gone? That means there's no SMS Event active at the moment and you can access the Phone normally."
    new "注意到手机按钮不抖了、红点也消失了吗？这说明当前没有短信事件在进行，你可以正常打开手机了。"

    old "So let's get this over with, shall we?"
    new "那就赶紧把这事办完吧，好吗？"

    old "GO AHEAD..."
    new "快点……"

    old "TOUCH IT!"
    new "点它！"

    old "You can close this window and click the Phone Button now."
    new "现在可以关掉这个窗口，然后点手机按钮了。"

    old "THE “I HOPE SENPAI WILL NOTICE ME THIS YEAR” SCREEN"
    new "「希望今年学长能注意到我」界面"

    old "Some Phone Features will bring you to this Character Selection screen before going to their proper screen."
    new "手机里的某些功能会先把你带到这个角色选择界面，然后才进入各自的页面。"

    old "Those features are character specific and, on this screen, you will be able to select which character data they'll be using."
    new "这些功能与角色绑定，在这个界面上你可以选择它们要使用哪位角色的数据。"

    old "Currently the features using this screen are the Profiles, the Gallery, the Wardrobe and, later on, the SMS system."
    new "目前走这个界面的功能有：档案、图库、衣柜，之后还会加上短信系统。"

    old "The usage of this screen is pretty straight forward, just click on the desired character on the list and that's it."
    new "这个界面的用法非常简单，在列表里点一下你想要的角色就行了。"

    old "See? I told you it was straight forward..."
    new "看吧？我都说了很简单吧……"

    old "THE “THIS FUCKING RUINS MY IMMERSION!” SCREEN"
    new "「这他妈毁了我的沉浸感！」界面"

    old "This is the Profiles Page! In here  you will find relevant data and information about the protagonist and the girls."
    new "这就是档案页！在这里你可以看到关于主角和各位姑娘的相关数据与信息。"

    old "This screen also serves as a hub for other character related features, so here's a quick explanation of what each element here does:"
    new "这个界面同时也是其他角色相关功能的枢纽，下面简单说明一下每个元素的作用："

    old "Feature Shortcuts: At the top left corner of the screen you will notice some buttons. Those are shortcuts for other character specific features, allowing you go to directly to them from the Profile Page and, when done on those screens, back to the Profiles Page again."
    new "功能快捷键：界面左上角有一些按钮，它们是其他角色专属功能的快捷入口，可以让你从档案页直接跳过去，用完之后再从那些界面回到档案页。"

    old "Currently you can use those buttons to access the Gallery and Wardrobe features, with the SMS and Gift systems being added to this list later on."
    new "目前这些按钮通向图库和衣柜功能，短信和礼物系统稍后也会加进来。"

    old "Clothing Toggle: After you reach a certain level of either Affection or Lust with a girl (they're unlocked from the get go for the protagonist's profile), these buttons will appear near the bottom left corner of the screen."
    new "服装切换：当你和某个姑娘的好感或情欲达到一定程度后（主角的档案一开始就解锁了），界面左下角附近就会出现这些按钮。"

    old "Those buttons will toggle what currently equip clothing category will be shown on the chracter's profile picture (the background on this screen). Each button switches through a category, being them Normal Clothing, Underwear/Lingerie and Swimwears and will show the clothing this character has currently equiped (you equip different clothing sets on the wardrobe screen). Note that this is purely aesthetic, for the Profile Page ONLY, and will not affect anything on the game."
    new "这些按钮用来切换角色档案图（也就是这个界面的背景）上显示哪一类服装。三个按钮分别对应日常服装、内衣和泳装，显示该角色当前穿着的那一套（你可以在衣柜界面给她换装）。注意，这纯粹是装饰效果，只作用于档案页，不会影响游戏里的任何内容。"

    old "Quick Profile Change: These buttons will allow you to cycle through all the character profiles available. It's meant as a quick way of viewing other character profiles without the need to go back to the Character Selection screen."
    new "快速切换档案：这些按钮可以让你在所有角色的档案之间轮换，方便快速查看其他角色，不用再退回角色选择界面。"

    old "And that's all for the Profile Page!"
    new "档案页就讲到这里！"

    old "STORE YOUR MEMORABLE, UH... MEMORIES... HERE!"
    new "把你那些难忘的、呃……回忆……存在这里吧！"

    old "This is the Gallery Page, all the pictures you obtain during the game will be shown on this screen."
    new "这就是图库页，游戏里获得的图片都会显示在这个界面上。"

    old "Pictures can be obtained through various means, most commonly will be by SMS messages with girls, story events and scattered around the world."
    new "图片有多种获取途径，最常见的是姑娘们发来的短信、剧情事件，以及散落在世界各地的图片。"

    old "This is a smart system and will only show pictures tagged for the currently selected chracter, a picture will be shown on a character's gallery if said characters appear on it. Usage of the Gallery system is pretty easy and goes as follows:"
    new "这是个智能系统，只会显示与当前选中角色相关的图片；只要某位角色出现在照片里，这张照片就会出现在她的图库中。图库的使用方法很简单："

    old "This is another pretty straight forward system. Just pick the picture you want to visualize from the list and it will take care of everything."
    new "这又是一个相当简单的系统。从列表里挑一张想看的图，剩下的它会自己搞定。"

    old "The phone screen might change orientation depending on whether the picture is in landscape or portrait variations. Once you're done with viewing the picture, just hit the “Return” button and you'll be back to the pictures list!"
    new "手机界面可能会根据图片是横图还是竖图自动切换方向。看完之后，点一下「返回」按钮就回到图片列表了！"

    old "And that's it for the Gallery tutorial, have fun!"
    new "图库教程到此为止，祝你玩得开心！"

    old "THIS IS WHERE I PUT MY REGRETS..."
    new "这里就是我放悔过录的地方……"

    old "This is the Special Episodes Page!"
    new "这就是特别章节页！"

    old "On this screen you'll find all the, you guessed it, Special Episodes released for The Inn!"
    new "在这个界面上，你会找到 The Inn 的所有——你猜对了——特别章节！"

    old "Right now it only has the Halloween Special released in 2018, if I ever release another Special Episode, it'll be featured in here too."
    new "目前里面只有 2018 年发布的万圣节特别篇；以后要是再出特别章节，也会出现在这里。"

    old "Also, keep in mind that all the Special Episodes are NOT canon and have no impact whatsoever on the main game's story (well, I mean, except unlockable stuff and maybe some flavor text)."
    new "另外请注意，所有特别章节都不是正传，对主线剧情毫无影响（当然，某些解锁内容和一点风味文本还是有的）。"

    old "Once again, pretty straight forward. Click on the episode button and it'll start automatically. The Special Episodes have a checkpoint system that will notify once a checkpoint is reached, meaning you won't need to finish it all in one go. You can leave any time you want and then you'll be able to resume from the last checkpoint the next time you open the Special Episode."
    new "老样子，非常简单。点一下章节按钮就会自动开始。特别章节带有存档点系统，到达存档点时会提示你，所以不必一口气打完。你随时可以离开，下次打开这个特别章节时就能从上一个存档点继续。"

    old "And that's it, nothing really... SPECIAL about it, right?"
    new "就这样，没什么 really……特别的，对吧？"

    old "THIS IS THE “I CAN TAKE MY WAIFU ANYWHERE” SCREEN"
    new "这是「我可以把老婆带到任何地方」界面"

    old "Welcome to the Wallpapers Page! In here you'll be able to switch your phone's wallpaper to anything you like."
    new "欢迎来到壁纸页！在这里你可以把手机壁纸换成任何你喜欢的东西。"

    old "As with all the other menus, on this one you just need to click on the wallpaper you want and that's it! The game comes bundled with several different wallpapers for you to chose."
    new "和其他所有菜单一样，在这个界面里只要点一下想要的壁纸就行了！游戏自带好几张壁纸供你挑选。"

    old "“But Lykanz, I don't like any of those!” Well, fear not, young one, you can use your own custom images as wallpapers, come with Papa Lykanz and I'll show you how:"
    new "「可是 Lykanz，我都不喜欢！」别担心，年轻人，你也可以用自己的图片当壁纸。来吧，跟着 Lykanz 爸爸，我教你怎么做："

    old "You can set any image as wallpaper of your phone, you just need to follow some simple steps."
    new "你可以把任意图片设成手机壁纸，只需按几个简单的步骤来。"

    old "First of all, navigate to the game's folder and open the “game” folder found inside it. In that folder you will find several other folders, the one you should look out for is the one named “wallpaper” (you can create it if it doesn't exist)."
    new "首先，进入游戏的文件夹，打开里面的「game」文件夹。里面会有若干子文件夹，你要找的是名为「wallpaper」的那个（如果没有就自己建一个）。"

    old "Go inside that folder and drop the images you want to use as wallpapers on it and that's it. Launch the game and the images you put there should appear on the wallpaper selection screen!"
    new "进到那个文件夹里，把你想用的图片丢进去就行了。启动游戏后，这些图片就会出现在壁纸选择界面上！"

    old "Beware, though, that the images will be resized to fit the phone screen, that means they could look a bit stretched sometimes."
    new "不过要注意，图片会被缩放以适应手机屏幕，所以有时看起来可能会有点拉伸。"

    old "Image formats compatible with this feature are: PNG, JPG/JPEG and WEBP."
    new "该功能支持的图片格式有：PNG、JPG/JPEG 和 WEBP。"

    old "And that's all for the Wallpapers Page, have fun!"
    new "壁纸页就讲到这里，祝你玩得开心！"

    old "THE “DOES THIS DRESS MAKES ME LOOK FAT?” SCREEN"
    new "「这条裙子让我显胖吗？」界面"

    old "This is the Wardrobe Page! In here you can change what clothing the protagonist and the girls wear during the game."
    new "这就是衣柜页！在这里你可以更换主角和各位姑娘在游戏中穿着的服装。"

    old "This Page is a litle more, uh... Convoluted than the others, but it's not too hard to understand. In this tutorial I will show you the basics of it, so come with me!"
    new "这一页比其他的要，呃……复杂那么一点，不过也不算太难懂。本教程会讲清楚它的基本用法，跟我来吧！"

    old "The first thing you'll notice in this screen is the preview panel. You can use this to see how the clothes will look on the character."
    new "你在这个界面上首先会注意到的是预览面板，可以用它查看衣服穿在角色身上的效果。"

    old "These previews are animated and will rotate to show you how the clothing looks from all angles."
    new "这些预览是动态的，会旋转展示服装各个角度的效果。"

    old "Next up is the Clothing Category tabs, by clicking in each one of them you'll switch between the clothing categories. That will take us to the next item on this tutorial."
    new "接下来是服装分类标签，点其中一个就能切换分类。这也引出了本教程的下一项内容。"

    old "These are the clothing buttons. Once you select the clothing category you want, all the available clothing for that category will show up in the frame below the tabs."
    new "这些是服装按钮。选定分类后，该分类下所有可用的服装就会出现在标签下方的框里。"

    old "If a clothing item is unlocked, you just need to click on it to equip it to the selected character."
    new "如果某件服装已解锁，只要点一下就能给当前选中的角色穿上。"

    old "To see how a character will look using a piece of clothing, simply click on the clothing buton and it'll be displayed in the preview window."
    new "想看某件服装穿在角色身上是什么样子，只要点一下那件衣服，它就会显示在预览窗口里。"

    old "You can go and dress your waifus up however you like now!"
    new "现在你可以随心所欲地给老婆们换装了！"

    old "WHAT??? MINIGAMES??? THIS GAME OFFICIALLY SUCKS!"
    new "什么？？？小游戏？？？这游戏正式变难看了！"

    old "I know, I know... Minigames suck... But this one is pretty simple and straight forward, come with me and I'll show you!"
    new "我知道，我知道……小游戏很烦……但这个相当简单直接，跟我来吧，我给你演示！"

    old "The first thing you'll notice is the text bouncing and telling you to slide sideways so you can see more massage points. You can do so by either clicking anywhere on the screen and dragging it, using the arrowkeys and page keys. With that out of the way, lets move on to the next parts!"
    new "你首先会看到一行弹跳的文字，提示你左右滑动以显示更多按摩点。你可以在屏幕任意位置按住拖动，也可以用方向键和翻页键。这个搞定之后，我们看看下一部分！"

    old "One of the first things you should pay attention is the intensity panel, you can use this one to adjust what will be the intensity to use during the massage."
    new "你首先要注意的是力度面板，可以用它调整按摩时使用的力度。"

    old "Sometimes the girl will ask for specific intensities, depending on what she likes, just pay attention to what she says during dialogues and you're set."
    new "有时姑娘会指定某个力度，取决于她的喜好；留意对话里她说了什么就没问题。"

    old "At the bottom center you can check the pleasure meter, it'll fill up depending on your choices as the minigame progresses."
    new "底部中央是舒适度量表，随着小游戏推进，它会根据你的选择逐渐填满。"

    old "Once the pleasure meter reaches a certain threshold (marked by the little heart) you'll get a nice reward!"
    new "一旦舒适度达到某个阈值（由那颗小心形标记），你就会得到一份不错的奖励！"

    old "Next thing you should look out for are the massage points. They are scattered around the screen on key positons. Once you hover over them you'll see the point's name and the intensity you have set beforehand. Just click on it and the minigame will proceed."
    new "接下来要留意的是按摩点。它们散布在屏幕各处的关键位置上。把鼠标移到上面，你会看到该部位名称和你之前设定的力度，直接点下去，小游戏就会继续。"

    old "Once again, the girl will tell you what part she wants massaged, so pay attention during the dialogues!"
    new "老规矩，姑娘会告诉你想按哪里，对话时留心点！"

    old "And lastly, if you couldn't care less about minigames or just want to speed through this part, just click the button at the bottom corner and the correct massage point and intensity will be set."
    new "最后，如果你完全不在乎小游戏、只想快点跳过这段，就点一下底角的那个按钮，正确的按摩点和力度会自动设置好。"

    old "And that's it for the massage minigame! Now get your hands all over that woman!"
    new "按摩小游戏就讲到这里！现在尽管在她身上放肆吧！"

    old "THIS IS THE \"WHAT THE HELL AM I SUPPOSED TO DO NOW?\" SCREEN"
    new "这是「我现在到底该干什么？」界面"

    old "This is the Event Log screen! It'll give you detailed information on either active or finished events on this game! (I think I said that already, didn't I?)"
    new "这就是事件记录界面！它会给你游戏中进行中或已完成事件的详细信息！（我好像已经说过一遍了，对吧？）"

    old "Anyway, this screen will be useful if you don't know what do to to progress in the game and the navigation system didn't give you enough info on what to do next. The screen itself is pretty straight forward, choose what events you want to check out, their categories and then select the event on the list that will be displayed."
    new "总之，如果你不知道该怎么推进游戏、而导航系统给的信息又不够用，这个界面会很有用。界面本身很简单：先选想查看的事件类型，再从列表里选中某个事件显示出来。"

    old "While it is, as I said, straight forward, there are some things you should pay attention on this screen."
    new "虽然如我所说很简单，但这个界面上还是有几点值得留意。"

    old "Once you select an event category the Event List box will appear. It shows a scrollable list (mousewheel, draggable, arrow keys and page keys) of all the events in the category you selected."
    new "选定事件分类后，事件列表框就会出现，其中显示该分类下所有事件的可滚动列表（可用滚轮、拖动、方向键和翻页键操作）。"

    old "From there you can just click on the event's name and a new box will show up with all the detailed information about the selected event."
    new "从那里点一下事件名称，就会弹出一个新框，显示所选事件的全部详细信息。"

    old "At the bottom left corner of the event's image you'll see details like what characters and what location the currently selected event is related to."
    new "在事件图片的左下角，你会看到诸如该事件涉及哪些角色、发生在哪个地点之类的信息。"

    old "This icon will be displayed at the top right corner of the event's image if the currently selected event is compatible with the Wardrobe System."
    new "如果当前所选事件与衣柜系统兼容，事件图片的右上角会显示这个图标。"

    old "And lastly, just under the event's image you'll find a short description on what the currently selected event is about and some helpful tips on what to do."
    new "最后，事件图片正下方会有该事件的简短说明，以及一些实用的行动建议。"

    old "That's all folks, have fun with the Event Log!"
    new "就这些，各位，祝你们玩得开心！"

    old "To dress a character up, just click or tap on the desired clothing and ta-da, they're wearing it now! A green check mark will appear at the top right corner of the clothing icon to signalize that clothing item is currently being used by the character."
    new "给角色换装，只要点击或轻触想要的那件衣服，嗒——现在就穿上了！衣服图标右上角会出现一个绿色对勾，表示这件衣服正被该角色穿着。"

    old "THE \"I HOPE SENPAI WILL NOTICE ME THIS YEAR\" SCREEN"
    new "「希望今年学长能注意到我」界面"

    old "THE \"THIS FUCKING RUINS MY IMMERSION!\" SCREEN"
    new "「这他妈毁了我的沉浸感！」界面"

    old "Feature Shortcuts"
    new "功能快捷键"

    old "At the top left corner of the screen you will notice some buttons. Those are shortcuts for other character specific features, allowing you go to directly to them from the Profile Page and, when done on those screens, back to the Profiles Page again."
    new "功能快捷键：界面左上角有一些按钮，它们是其他角色专属功能的快捷入口，可以让你从档案页直接跳过去，用完之后再从那些界面回到档案页。"

    old "Clothing Toggle"
    new "服装切换"

    old "After you reach a certain level of either Affection or Lust with a girl (they're unlocked from the get go for the protagonist's profile), these buttons will appear near the bottom left corner of the screen."
    new "当你和某个姑娘的好感或情欲达到一定程度后（主角的档案一开始就解锁了），界面左下角附近就会出现这些按钮。"

    old "Quick Profile Change"
    new "快速切换档案"

    old "These buttons will allow you to cycle through all the character profiles available. It's meant as a quick way of viewing other character profiles without the need to go back to the Character Selection screen."
    new "这些按钮可以让你在所有角色的档案之间轮换，方便快速查看其他角色，不用再退回角色选择界面。"

    old "The phone screen might change orientation depending on whether the picture is in landscape or portrait variations. Once you're done with viewing the picture, just hit the \"Return\" button and you'll be back to the pictures list!"
    new "手机界面可能会根据图片是横图还是竖图自动切换方向。看完之后，点一下「返回」按钮就回到图片列表了！"

    old "THIS IS THE \"I CAN TAKE MY WAIFU ANYWHERE\" SCREEN"
    new "这是「我可以把老婆带到任何地方」界面"

    old "\"But Lykanz, I don't like any of those!\" Well, fear not, young one, you can use your own custom images as wallpapers, come with Papa Lykanz and I'll show you how:"
    new "「可是 Lykanz，我都不喜欢！」别担心，年轻人，你也可以用自己的图片当壁纸。来吧，跟着 Lykanz 爸爸，我教你怎么做："

    old "First of all, navigate to the game's folder and open the \"game\" folder found inside it. In that folder you will find several other folders, the one you should look out for is the one named \"wallpaper\" (you can create it if it doesn't exist)."
    new "首先，进入游戏的文件夹，打开里面的「game」文件夹。里面会有若干子文件夹，你要找的是名为「wallpaper」的那个（如果没有就自己建一个）。"

